  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Madcap Meks",
    "summary": "In [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), whenever all the ranged attacks of a **BIG MEK**, **MEK GUNZ**, **MORKANAUT** or **WAZBOM BLASTAJET** unit of yours target one enemy unit, roll a D6. Each D6 result gives an effect:\n\n- **Dat's Weird** (1): the target gets a 4+ [invulnerable save](vsdata:core-rule/save-rolls) until your unit finishes shooting.\n- **Hop Splat** (2-3): pick another enemy unit up to 3\" from the target; that other unit takes D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds).\n- **Seekerz** (4): those attacks get +1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls).\n- **Lifted** (5): the target gets **FLY** and is denied the [benefit of cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover), both until your unit finishes shooting.\n- **Runtified** (6): the target gets -1 T, lasting until your unit finishes shooting.",
